@*
    The chrome-free layout: sign-in, sign-up, password reset, and anything else
    that runs before there is an account to render a shell around.

    It carries the toast host — a failed sign-in has to be able to say so — and
    nothing else.
*@

@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<div class="authlayout">
    @Body
</div>

<ToastHost />
<RouteTracker />

<div id="blazor-error-ui">
    Something on this page didn't load.
    <a href="" class="reload">Reload</a>
    <a class="dismiss" onclick="this.closest('#blazor-error-ui').style.display='none'">Dismiss</a>
</div>
